  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Changes since 7.6.1\n* Fixed an issue where Span ``CopyTo`` methods relied on Span ``GetRange`` methods and vice versa causing an infinite loop\n* Fixed an issue where Span ``CopyTo`` methods created a new destination Span rather than adding to an already existing Span - This is a breaking change, as it changes the destination from ``out destination`` to ``ref destination`` but corrects unintended prior behaviour.\n* Optimized Span ``RemoveRange`` and ``GetRange`` code\n* Deprecated ``TryGetIndicesOf``, ``TryGetIndexOf`` IEnumerable<T> extension methods for removal in v8 - Please use the ``IndicesOf`` or ``IndexOf``, and check for an empty IEnumerable<T> or -1 respectively for cases where the item isn't found.",
  "repository": "",
